  "title": "Lexaria’s Human Study GLP-1-H26-7 Has Begun Dosing on Schedule",
  "summary": "KELOWNA, BC / ACCESS Newswire / June 25, 2026 / Lexaria Bioscience Corp. (NASDAQ:LEXX) (the “Company” or “Lexaria“), a global innovator in drug delivery platforms, announces that dosing began on schedule on June 14th with Human Pilot Study #7 (GLP-1-H26-7) that is evaluating two oral DehydraTECH-semaglutide (“DHT-sema”) compositions against Novo Nordisk’s® (“Novo”) commercially available Wegovy® … Continue reading Lexaria’s Human Study GLP-1-H26-7 Has Begun Dosing on Schedule",
